{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_vrtx_01JCgakCv6r34jkWosKxY2YW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. I wrote **Q36: Agent analyzing support tickets, drafting responses, escalating** (`03-036`).\n\nThe answer covers:\n\n- **Architecture:** ReAct/LangGraph loop with 5 typed tools — `classify_ticket`, `retrieve_context`, `draft_response`, `send_response`, `escalate_to_human`\n- **RAG layer:** Hybrid BM25+Pinecone with RRF fusion + Cohere Rerank (top-5) — critical for support tickets with product codes and error IDs that dense-only retrieval misses\n- **Escalation gate:** In orchestrator code (not prompts) — triggers on confidence < 0.85, urgency = critical, enterprise billing disputes, or >4 tool calls without convergence\n- **Memory:** Working (in-context), episodic (Redis, 90-day TTL), semantic (Pinecone KB), procedural (system prompt escalation rules)\n- **Cost math:** GPT-4o-mini at ~$100/day for 1M tickets vs $400K–1.9M/day for human agents\n- **Eval SLOs:** deflection rate, draft_acceptance_rate, CSAT delta — confidence threshold tuned on 200+ labeled golden tickets\n\nNext up: **Q37 — Agents collaborating on research reports with citations.**"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":292,"cache_read_input_tokens":65448,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":292,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"60999549-2928-49f2-a083-65fd0b3a3f99","uuid":"62538297-df01-4789-a6df-12296a77872b"}
